{"kind":"symbol","metadata":{"navigatorTitle":[{"text":"Reference","kind":"identifier"}],"modules":[{"name":"RegexBuilder"}],"externalID":"s:12RegexBuilder9ReferenceV","title":"Reference","role":"symbol","symbolKind":"struct","fragments":[{"text":"struct","kind":"keyword"},{"text":" ","kind":"text"},{"text":"Reference","kind":"identifier"}],"roleHeading":"Structure","platforms":[{"deprecated":false,"name":"iOS","unavailable":false,"beta":false,"introducedAt":"16.0"},{"deprecated":false,"name":"iPadOS","introducedAt":"16.0","unavailable":false,"beta":false},{"deprecated":false,"name":"Mac Catalyst","unavailable":false,"beta":false,"introducedAt":"16.0"},{"deprecated":false,"name":"macOS","introducedAt":"13.0","unavailable":false,"beta":false},{"deprecated":false,"name":"tvOS","introducedAt":"16.0","unavailable":false,"beta":false},{"deprecated":false,"name":"watchOS","unavailable":false,"beta":false,"introducedAt":"9.0"}]},"hierarchy":{"paths":[["doc:\/\/com.apple.Swift\/documentation\/RegexBuilder"]]},"sections":[],"seeAlsoSections":[{"generated":true,"title":"Captures","anchor":"Captures","identifiers":["doc:\/\/com.apple.Swift\/documentation\/RegexBuilder\/Capture","doc:\/\/com.apple.Swift\/documentation\/RegexBuilder\/TryCapture"]}],"schemaVersion":{"minor":3,"patch":0,"major":0},"identifier":{"url":"doc:\/\/com.apple.Swift\/documentation\/RegexBuilder\/Reference","interfaceLanguage":"swift"},"abstract":[{"type":"text","text":"A reference to a captured portion of a regular expression."}],"relationshipsSections":[{"title":"Conforms To","identifiers":["doc:\/\/com.apple.Swift\/documentation\/Swift\/RegexComponent"],"type":"conformsTo","kind":"relationships"}],"primaryContentSections":[{"declarations":[{"platforms":["macOS"],"tokens":[{"text":"struct","kind":"keyword"},{"text":" ","kind":"text"},{"kind":"identifier","text":"Reference"},{"text":"<","kind":"text"},{"text":"Capture","kind":"genericParameter"},{"text":">","kind":"text"}],"languages":["swift"]}],"kind":"declarations"},{"kind":"content","content":[{"level":2,"text":"Overview","type":"heading","anchor":"overview"},{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"text":"You can use a ","type":"text"},{"code":"Reference","type":"codeVoice"},{"type":"text","text":" to access a regular expression, both during"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"type":"text","text":"the matching process and after a capture has been successful."}]},{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"text":"In this example, the ","type":"text"},{"code":"kind","type":"codeVoice"},{"type":"text","text":" reference captures either "},{"code":"\"CREDIT\"","type":"codeVoice"},{"text":" or","type":"text"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"\"DEBIT\""},{"type":"text","text":" at the beginning of a line. Later in the regular expression, the"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"presence of "},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"kind"},{"type":"text","text":" matches the same substring that was captured previously"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"at the end of the line."}]},{"syntax":"swift","code":["let kindRef = Reference(Substring.self)","let kindRegex = ChoiceOf {","    \"CREDIT\"","    \"DEBIT\"","}","","let transactionRegex = Regex {","    Anchor.startOfLine","    Capture(kindRegex, as: kindRef)","    OneOrMore(.anyNonNewline)","    kindRef","    Anchor.endOfLine","}","","let validTransaction = \"CREDIT     109912311421    Payroll   $69.73  CREDIT\"","let invalidTransaction = \"DEBIT     00522142123    Expense   $5.17  CREDIT\"","","print(validTransaction.contains(transactionRegex))","\/\/ Prints \"true\"","print(invalidTransaction.contains(transactionRegex))","\/\/ Prints \"false\""],"type":"codeListing"},{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"Any reference that is used for matching must be captured elsewhere in the"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"Regex"},{"type":"text","text":" block. You can use a reference for matching before it is captured;"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"in that case, the reference will not match until it has previously been"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"captured."}]},{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"To access the captured “transaction kind”, you can use the "},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"kind"},{"type":"text","text":" reference"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"to subscript a "},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"Regex.Match"},{"type":"text","text":" instance:"}]},{"syntax":"swift","code":["if let match = validTransaction.firstMatch(of: transactionRegex) {","    print(match[kindRef])","}","\/\/ Prints \"CREDIT\""],"type":"codeListing"},{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"To use a "},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"Reference"},{"type":"text","text":" to capture a transformed value, include a "},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"transform"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"closure when capturing."}]},{"syntax":"swift","code":["struct Transaction {","    var id: UInt64","}","let transactionRef = Reference(Transaction.self)","","let transactionIDRegex = Regex {","    Capture(kindRegex, as: kindRef)","    OneOrMore(.whitespace)","    TryCapture(as: transactionRef) {","        OneOrMore(.digit)","    } transform: { str in","        UInt64(str).map(Transaction.init(id:))","    }","    OneOrMore(.anyNonNewline)","    kindRef","    Anchor.endOfLine","}","","if let match = validTransaction.firstMatch(of: transactionIDRegex) {","    print(match[transactionRef])","}","\/\/ Prints \"Transaction(id: 109912311421)\""],"type":"codeListing"}]}],"variants":[{"paths":["\/documentation\/regexbuilder\/reference"],"traits":[{"interfaceLanguage":"swift"}]}],"topicSections":[{"title":"Initializers","anchor":"Initializers","generated":true,"identifiers":["doc:\/\/com.apple.Swift\/documentation\/RegexBuilder\/Reference\/init(_:)"]},{"title":"Instance Properties","anchor":"Instance-Properties","generated":true,"identifiers":["doc:\/\/com.apple.Swift\/documentation\/RegexBuilder\/Reference\/regex"]}],"references":{"doc://com.apple.Swift/documentation/RegexBuilder":{"title":"RegexBuilder","url":"\/documentation\/regexbuilder","kind":"symbol","type":"topic","identifier":"doc:\/\/com.apple.Swift\/documentation\/RegexBuilder","role":"collection","abstract":[]},"doc://com.apple.Swift/documentation/RegexBuilder/TryCapture":{"kind":"symbol","abstract":[{"type":"text","text":"A regex component that attempts to transform a matched substring, saving"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"type":"text","text":"the result if successful and backtracking if the transformation fails."}],"role":"symbol","title":"TryCapture","fragments":[{"kind":"keyword","text":"struct"},{"text":" ","kind":"text"},{"kind":"identifier","text":"TryCapture"}],"type":"topic","navigatorTitle":[{"kind":"identifier","text":"TryCapture"}],"identifier":"doc:\/\/com.apple.Swift\/documentation\/RegexBuilder\/TryCapture","url":"\/documentation\/regexbuilder\/trycapture"},"doc://com.apple.Swift/documentation/RegexBuilder/Reference/init(_:)":{"identifier":"doc:\/\/com.apple.Swift\/documentation\/RegexBuilder\/Reference\/init(_:)","kind":"symbol","type":"topic","role":"symbol","url":"\/documentation\/regexbuilder\/reference\/init(_:)","fragments":[{"text":"init","kind":"identifier"},{"text":"(","kind":"text"},{"text":"Capture","kind":"typeIdentifier","preciseIdentifier":"s:12RegexBuilder9ReferenceV7Capturexmfp"},{"text":".Type)","kind":"text"}],"title":"init(_:)","abstract":[{"type":"text","text":"Creates a reference with the specified capture type."}]},"doc://com.apple.Swift/documentation/Swift/RegexComponent":{"abstract":[{"text":"A type that represents a regular expression.","type":"text"}],"kind":"symbol","role":"symbol","title":"RegexComponent","fragments":[{"text":"protocol","kind":"keyword"},{"text":" ","kind":"text"},{"text":"RegexComponent","kind":"identifier"}],"type":"topic","navigatorTitle":[{"text":"RegexComponent","kind":"identifier"}],"identifier":"doc:\/\/com.apple.Swift\/documentation\/Swift\/RegexComponent","url":"\/documentation\/swift\/regexcomponent"},"doc://com.apple.Swift/documentation/RegexBuilder/Reference/regex":{"fragments":[{"text":"var","kind":"keyword"},{"text":" ","kind":"text"},{"text":"regex","kind":"identifier"},{"text":": ","kind":"text"},{"text":"Regex","preciseIdentifier":"s:17_StringProcessing5RegexV","kind":"typeIdentifier"},{"text":"<","kind":"text"},{"text":"Capture","preciseIdentifier":"s:12RegexBuilder9ReferenceV7Capturexmfp","kind":"typeIdentifier"},{"text":">","kind":"text"}],"type":"topic","url":"\/documentation\/regexbuilder\/reference\/regex","title":"regex","role":"symbol","identifier":"doc:\/\/com.apple.Swift\/documentation\/RegexBuilder\/Reference\/regex","kind":"symbol","abstract":[]},"doc://com.apple.Swift/documentation/RegexBuilder/Reference":{"identifier":"doc:\/\/com.apple.Swift\/documentation\/RegexBuilder\/Reference","kind":"symbol","type":"topic","role":"symbol","url":"\/documentation\/regexbuilder\/reference","fragments":[{"text":"struct","kind":"keyword"},{"text":" ","kind":"text"},{"text":"Reference","kind":"identifier"}],"navigatorTitle":[{"text":"Reference","kind":"identifier"}],"title":"Reference","abstract":[{"type":"text","text":"A reference to a captured portion of a regular expression."}]},"doc://com.apple.Swift/documentation/RegexBuilder/Capture":{"identifier":"doc:\/\/com.apple.Swift\/documentation\/RegexBuilder\/Capture","kind":"symbol","type":"topic","role":"symbol","url":"\/documentation\/regexbuilder\/capture","fragments":[{"text":"struct","kind":"keyword"},{"text":" ","kind":"text"},{"text":"Capture","kind":"identifier"}],"navigatorTitle":[{"text":"Capture","kind":"identifier"}],"title":"Capture","abstract":[{"type":"text","text":"A regex component that saves the matched substring, or a transformed result,"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"for access in a regex match."}]}}